8. Conformance

An implementation conforms to ADS if it:

Implements canonical Atlas objects.
Preserves canonical semantics.
Supports canonical metadata.
Implements version management.
Maintains traceability.
Conforms to validation rules.
9. Future Evolution

Future revisions MAY introduce:

Domain-specific engineering profiles.
Knowledge graph mappings.
Digital Twin schemas.
Ontology bindings.
Semantic compression.
Federated engineering data spaces.

All extensions SHALL remain compatible with the Canonical Atlas Object model.